# OPERATOR STATE. `make pi-ship` does not overwrite the copy on the Pi
# (PI_OWNED in the Makefile). git holds only the seed for a fresh
# install. Edit on the Pi: `sudo pf tui`, House lists, then apply --local.
#
# House only. Agent segments read direct_ip.allow. Addresses or CIDRs that
# a house device may connect to on 80 and 443 when the house resolver did
# not give them first (HOUSE_BLOCK_DIRECT_IP=on). The use case is a device
# or app that dials a fixed address, for example a TV or a printer cloud.
# One address or CIDR per line, /24 at the widest.
